{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20260817/photo/bkn-20260817120253018-0817_00822_001_01p.jpg?20260817121434\"/><p>高溫觸發的雷雨正影響本港。天文台今日(17日)正午12時預料未來數小時本港部分地區雨勢較大及有狂風雷暴。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-17T04:19:43.653395+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":60,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none"}}